    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Jack of Spades. Straight flush. I win again, Gambino."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You win again. But you deal slower than I do with my toes."
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$bar_intro",
            "key": "$bar_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#4",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You backin' out again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Shut up."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Shut up? Wish you knew how to shut up last night. Coulda saved us a lotta trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.4,
            "xstrength": 0,
            "ystrength": 8,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 30,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You been in Lungmen a long time, Capone. Maybe you need a reminder in how you talk to me, the boss."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Sit down, you moron. It's thanks to that temper of yours that business in Siracusa's so lousy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You been here seven or eight years, and what've you done besides learn some Lungmen swearings? You stood here and watched our channels dry up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "I'm the one who got us a supporter last night. Try as you did to cock it up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "And besides, here in Lungmen, you and me are equals, 'boss.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "The way this Rat King runs the show here, ain't it just the old worn out Siracusan tricks?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "If only you could play a good Siracusan hand worth a damn."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Too bad you're the worst card in it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "We got a role to play in Lungmen. Think about it: we got a tired, broken down city with a rich underworld. It could be a new home for the Family."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Only Siracusa can truly respect us, Capone. Don't forget the shame of being driven out of our home with our tails between our legs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "You can't eat honor."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Wei Yenwu set some rules for this city. As long as we don't break 'em, we can run our rackets here just like before. Lungmen needs a little 'legitimate business.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "...I ain't seen you in years and I'm already gettin' sick of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Same same, boss."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "You...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Can you not have your noisy lovers' quarrel in here? This lousy champagne's doin' enough to piss me off. Grab a bottle and take it outside, aight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Get outta here. This don't concern you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Watch your tone. I'm the boss in here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "We got a one-stop funeral service, if you're interested. 20% off if you both die together."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Hey... ain't this guy...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "...This is what we get since we left Siracusa. Nobody knows you're Sicilian."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Who gives a shit who you are?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gambino",
        "text": "Yo, Capone, do me a favor and torch this tacky joint. Call it 'urban beautification.' Wei Yenwu'll thank us for tearin' down a tastelessly decorated rathole."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_028#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_027#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Capone",
        "text": "Quiet! Don't provoke him!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Oh?"
    },
